{"ref":"BDB, כִּידוֹן","hw":"כִּידוֹן","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">כִּידוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>dart, javelin (</strong>NH <em>id.</em><strong>)</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:18\" href=\"/Joshua.8.18\">Jos 8:18</a> + 6 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּידֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:42\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.42\">Je 50:42</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּידוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.6\">1 S 17:6</a>;—<em>dart, javelin</em> (distinct from <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנִית</span> <em>spear, lance</em>, q.v.), <span dir=\"rtl\">נטה בַּכּ׳ אשׁר ביד(ך)</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:18\" href=\"/Joshua.8.18\">Jos 8:18</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:26\" href=\"/Joshua.8.26\">26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">רַעַשׁ כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 41:21\" href=\"/Job.41.21\">Jb 41:21</a> <em>the rushing sound of a dart;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחֶרֶב וּבַחֲנִית וּבְכ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:45\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.45\">1 S 17:45</a> (weapons of Goliath), <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳ נְחשֶׁת בֵּין כְּתֵפָיו</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.6\">6</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנִית</span> in v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.7\">7</a>); + <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנִית</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:23\" href=\"/Job.39.23\">Jb 39:23</a> also; <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶשֶׁת וְכ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.23\">Je 6:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:42\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.42\">50:42</a>.","next":"BDB, כִּידֹן","prev":"BDB, כיד"}